focus_prompt.user_template:
Extract metadata from this bug report and output ONLY a JSON object (nothing before or after):

{description}

Output exactly this JSON structure with no markdown, no explanation, no extra text:
{"title": "...", "component": "...", "reported_by": "...", "date": "..."}

Classify severity and priority for this bug and output ONLY JSON with no explanation:

Title: {metadata.title}
Component: {metadata.component}
Reporter: {metadata.reported_by}
Date: {metadata.date}

Output exactly this JSON structure (no markdown, no extra text). The `reasoning` field MUST be a single-line, non-empty string (minimum 20 words):
{"severity": "critical|high|medium|low", "priority": "P0|P1|P2|P3", "reasoning": "A concise, single-paragraph justification (min 20 words)"}

Generate reproduction steps for this bug and output ONLY JSON with no explanation:

Title: {metadata.title}
Component: {metadata.component}
Bug description: {description}

Output exactly this JSON structure (no markdown, no extra text):
{"steps": [{"step_number": 1, "action": "...", "expected": "...", "actual": "..."}, ...]}

Analyze the root cause of this bug and output ONLY JSON with no explanation:

Title: {metadata.title}
Component: {metadata.component}
Repro steps: {reproduction.steps}

Output exactly this JSON structure (no markdown, no extra text):
{"root_cause": "detailed explanation", "technical_depth": "shallow|moderate|deep", "hypothesis_confidence": 0.85}

Generate exactly 2 proposed fixes for this bug and output ONLY JSON with no explanation:

Title: {metadata.title}
Component: {metadata.component}
Root cause: {root_cause.root_cause}

Output exactly this JSON structure (no markdown, no extra text). The "fixes" array MUST contain 2 objects and each object MUST include: name (string), approach (string), pros (non-empty array of strings), cons (non-empty array of strings), effort_hours (integer). Set "recommended_index" to the index (0 or 1) of the recommended fix. Example output:
{"fixes": [{"name": "Fix Option 1", "approach": "Make X change to Y module", "pros": ["fast", "low risk"], "cons": ["temporary"], "effort_hours": 8}, {"name": "Fix Option 2", "approach": "Refactor Z subsystem", "pros": ["robust"], "cons": ["longer", "requires migration"], "effort_hours": 40}], "recommended_index": 0}

Generate an executive summary and output ONLY JSON with no explanation:

Severity: {severity.severity}
Priority: {severity.priority}
Root cause: {root_cause.root_cause}
Recommended fix: {proposed_fixes.fixes[{proposed_fixes.recommended_index}].name}

Output exactly this JSON structure (no markdown, no extra text). The `summary` MUST be a single JSON string (no nested objects), plain text only, 150-250 words:
{"summary": "A clear, actionable executive summary (150-250 words)."}
